  "238":{"n":"Deep Pockets","k":"Passive item","d":"Allows Isaac to carry two cards or pills (or a combination of both) at the same time. Increases the coin cap to 999. If a room would otherwise yield no reward, 1-3 coins will spawn.","w":"Deep Pockets","i":"61263d00174ed48329041c3cfad09363c28ee484.jpg"},
  "239":{"n":"Karma","k":"Trinket","d":"Donating to a Donation Machine, Blood Donation Machine, or Confessional has a chance to heal Isaac for a full Red Heart or spawn a Beggar. Increases the chance that donating to a Donation Machine will increase Isaac's luck. Reduces the chance of the Donation Machine jamming. Donating to a Beggar has a chance to heal Is","q":"Karma up","w":"Karma","i":"03c4e2b2b7079d1fbefb51083a9c30d805d142ee.jpg"},
  "240":{"n":"Sticky Nickels","k":"Pickup","d":"Sticky Nickels: nickels that stick to the ground and must be bombed or touched a few times before you can collect them.","w":"Coins","i":"6fb8bfbc559df94b4c7ff4a30bad43c69755c3e8.jpg"},
  "241":{"n":"Super Greed Baby","k":"Co-op baby","d":"Co-op baby. Has the Head of the Keeper effect, firing coin tears that have a chance to spawn a coin upon hitting an enemy.","w":"Co-op","i":"4027fe3f0fd80890947ed748090d5740d1c3cbc9.jpg"},
  "282":{"n":"D infinity","k":"Active item","d":"Has the effect of a random die item that changes each use. Replicates the effect of a selected die item (except Spindown Dice), and can be cycled through by pressing the drop key.","q":"Reroll forever","w":"D infinity","i":"72e09df69b4d35b32da0da725cd61473f7a418a2.jpg"},
