  "416":{"n":"Wisp Baby","k":"Co-op baby","d":"Co-op baby skin with no special effect.","w":"Co-op","i":"c860bc923ab4e78f5a37818f08989de8979a3926.jpg"},
  "417":{"n":"Book of Virtues","k":"Active item","d":"Passively causes active items to spawn themed orbital wisp familiars on use, which fire tears and block shots. Can be activated to spawn a basic wisp if Isaac has no other active item.","q":"Spiritual companionship","w":"Book of Virtues","i":"9948a37b700e9afd90377df97a39f1fd391a7c74.jpg"},
  "418":{"n":"Urn of Souls","k":"Active item","d":"Isaac pulls out or puts away an urn that fires a stream of damaging blue flames. It gains Soul Charges each time an enemy dies, which are used to fuel the urn.","q":"Unleash their sorrow","w":"Urn of Souls","i":"74ca45c03a61b25df73e01e6b6bddada79ebb41e.jpg"},
  "419":{"n":"Blessed Penny","k":"Trinket","d":"Gives a chance to drop a Half Soul Heart when a coin is collected.","q":"Wealth of purity","w":"Blessed Penny","i":"93d00c663639fdab0df79c1df6bf6061808cd5e6.jpg"},
  "420":{"n":"Alabaster Box","k":"Active item","d":"Upon use, spawns three Soul Hearts and two Angel Room items and is consumed. Starts with no charges, and can only be charged by picking up 6 Soul Hearts.","q":"A sacred offering","w":"Alabaster Box","i":"63d72276ff3030f2fcd5f3359602a62036fb1e4d.jpg"},
  "421":{"n":"Beth's Faith","k":"Trinket","d":"At the beginning of each floor, spawn 4-8 wisps that orbit Isaac and fires tears alongside him.","q":"My faith protects me","w":"Beth's Faith","i":"83b14612b9f8f4b2eddfff8e51f1ab38df5682bb.jpg"},
